---
import Admin from '../layouts/Admin.astro';
import UiIcon from '../components/UiIcon.astro';
---
<Admin><section id="owner-login" class="owner-login"><p class="eyebrow">DIGIVATED ADMIN</p><h1>Welcome back.</h1><p>Sign in to review projects, manage content, and oversee your workspace.</p><form id="owner-login-form"><label for="owner-password">Owner password</label><input id="owner-password" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" minlength="10" maxlength="200" required/><button class="button primary" type="submit" disabled>Sign in</button></form><p class="quiet">Owner access only. Use your separate dashboard password.</p><noscript>Enable JavaScript to use the owner dashboard.</noscript></section>
<p id="owner-status" class="owner-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1">Checking owner access…</p>

<section id="owner-dashboard" hidden>
  <header class="owner-workspace-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">DIGIVATED ADMIN</p><h1>Your workspace.</h1><p>Review, publish, and keep things moving.</p></div><a class="owner-news-shortcut" href="/admin/news">Open News desk <UiIcon name="arrow" size={18}/></a></header>
  <div class="owner-workspace-grid">
    <aside class="owner-sidebar" aria-label="Workspace navigation">
      <p class="owner-nav-label">WORKSPACE</p>
      <nav class="owner-tabs" aria-label="Manage content">
        <button class="button" type="button" data-owner-panel="overview" aria-pressed="true"><UiIcon name="grid" size={18}/><span>Overview</span></button>
        <button type="button" class="button" data-kind="submission" aria-pressed="false"><UiIcon name="layers" size={18}/><span>Submissions</span></button><button type="button" class="button" data-kind="comments" aria-pressed="false"><UiIcon name="comment" size={18}/><span>Comments</span></button><button type="button" class="button" data-kind="resource" aria-pressed="false"><UiIcon name="tool" size={18}/><span>Articles</span></button><button type="button" class="button" data-kind="product" aria-pressed="false"><UiIcon name="grid" size={18}/><span>Products</span></button><button type="button" class="button" data-kind="accounts" aria-pressed="false"><UiIcon name="profile" size={18}/><span>Accounts</span></button>
        <a href="/admin/news"><UiIcon name="book" size={18}/><span>News desk</span></a>
        <a href="/admin/analytics"><UiIcon name="chart" size={18}/><span>Analytics</span></a>
        <button class="button" type="button" data-owner-panel="settings" aria-pressed="false"><UiIcon name="tool" size={18}/><span>Store setup</span></button>
      </nav>
      <div class="owner-sidebar-note"><span class="owner-session-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Private owner workspace</span></div>
    </aside>
    <div class="owner-workspace-main">
      <section id="owner-overview" aria-labelledby="owner-overview-title">
        <header class="owner-section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">AT A GLANCE</p><h2 id="owner-overview-title">Workspace overview</h2><p id="owner-overview-updated">Loading your workspace…</p></div><button class="button" id="owner-overview-refresh" type="button">Refresh overview</button></header>
        <p id="owner-overview-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <div class="owner-metrics">
          <button type="button" data-open-kind="submission" data-open-status="pending" class="owner-metric"><span>Awaiting review</span><strong data-overview-number="pending">—</strong><small>Open submission queue</small></button>
          <button type="button" data-open-kind="submission" class="owner-metric"><span>Approved projects</span><strong data-overview-number="published">—</strong><small>Approved + featured</small></button>
          <button type="button" data-open-kind="submission" data-open-status="featured" class="owner-metric"><span>Featured projects</span><strong data-overview-number="featured">—</strong><small>Manage the spotlight</small></button>
          <a href="/admin/news" class="owner-metric"><span>News to review</span><strong data-overview-number="newsReview">—</strong><small>Open News desk</small></a>
        </div>
        <div class="owner-overview-panels">
          <section class="owner-dashboard-panel"><header><div><h3>Submission activity</h3><p>New submissions · last 7 days (UTC)</p></div><strong id="owner-activity-total">—</strong></header><ol id="owner-activity-chart" class="owner-activity-chart" aria-label="Daily submissions over the last seven days"></ol></section>
          <section class="owner-dashboard-panel"><header><div><h3>Review pipeline</h3><p>All submission statuses</p></div><strong data-overview-number="total">—</strong></header><div id="owner-pipeline" class="owner-pipeline"></div></section>
        </div>
        <section class="owner-dashboard-panel owner-library-summary"><header><div><h3>Content library</h3><p>Jump into the content you manage.</p></div></header><div class="owner-library-links"><button type="button" data-open-kind="comments" data-open-status="pending"><span>Pending feedback</span><strong data-overview-number="comments">—</strong></button><button type="button" data-open-kind="resource"><span>Articles</span><strong data-overview-number="articles">—</strong></button><button type="button" data-open-kind="product"><span>Products</span><strong data-overview-number="products">—</strong></button></div></section>
      </section>
      <section id="owner-content" hidden aria-labelledby="owner-content-title"><header class="owner-section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">CONTENT MANAGEMENT</p><h2 id="owner-content-title">Submissions</h2><p id="owner-content-description">Review incoming projects and manage their publication.</p></div></header><div class="owner-toolbar"><label><span id="owner-search-label">Search loaded items</span><input id="owner-search" type="search" placeholder="Name, title, or creator"/></label><label>Filter status<select id="owner-filter"><option value="">All statuses</option></select></label><button id="owner-refresh" class="button" type="button">Refresh</button><button id="owner-create" class="button primary" type="button" hidden>New article</button></div><p id="owner-search-note" class="quiet" hidden>Search filters loaded accounts. Use Load more to see older accounts.</p><p class="quiet" id="owner-count" role="status"></p><article class="owner-protected panel" id="owner-protected" hidden><div><span class="tag">Protected product</span><h2>UI/UX Prompt Packet</h2><p>Existing purchase access is preserved. The public shop now presents only Digivated Membership.</p></div><a class="button" href="/ui-ux-prompt-packet">View packet →</a></article><div id="owner-list" class="owner-list"></div><div id="owner-empty" class="community-empty" hidden><h2>No items found</h2><p>Try another filter or refresh the list.</p></div><button id="owner-more" class="button" type="button" hidden>Load more</button><p class="quiet owner-publish-note">Approved projects and published content appear on the site immediately on the next page load. Project feedback appears immediately. Resource comments still need approval. Packet feedback follows its separate permission rules. Email and private notes stay private.</p></section>
      <section id="owner-settings" hidden aria-labelledby="owner-settings-title"><header class="owner-section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">CONFIGURATION</p><h2 id="owner-settings-title">Store setup</h2><p>Membership checkout and seller configuration.</p></div></header><details id="gumroad-setup" class="owner-private owner-gumroad-setup"><summary>Gumroad membership setup</summary><p>Apply the prepared $5 one-time membership: one reviewed project spotlight and full member News summaries. This updates the membership listing and black/purple branding, uses a matching custom storefront if your Gumroad account supports it, and unpublishes the old packet, promotion, and tip offers. Existing purchases and files are preserved.</p><button id="owner-gumroad-rerun" class="button" type="button" hidden>Reapply Gumroad branding</button><form id="owner-gumroad-form" autocomplete="off"><label for="owner-gumroad-token">Gumroad seller API key<input id="owner-gumroad-token" name="gumroadToken" type="password" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" minlength="20" maxlength="500" data-private data-sentry-mask required aria-describedby="owner-gumroad-help"/></label><p id="owner-gumroad-help" class="quiet">Use a seller OAuth access token with product editing access (edit_products), not an application ID or client secret. Profile editing access is optional. Enter it here on digivated.com, not in chat. The key is sent over HTTPS to this site's authenticated server for this operation. It is not saved, logged, or returned.</p><button id="owner-gumroad-apply" class="button primary" type="submit">Update Gumroad and open checkout</button></form><p id="owner-gumroad-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p class="quiet"><a href="/membership" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Review the membership page ↗</a> · <a href="/membership-cover.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Preview the prepared cover ↗</a></p></details></section>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<dialog id="owner-editor" class="owner-editor" aria-labelledby="owner-editor-title"><header class="dialog-header"><h2 id="owner-editor-title">Review project</h2><button class="button small" id="owner-close" type="button">Close</button></header><div class="owner-editor-body"><p id="owner-editor-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1"></p><form id="owner-editor-form"><div id="owner-private-details"></div><div id="owner-fields"></div><div class="owner-editor-actions" id="owner-editor-actions"></div></form></div></dialog>
<script>import '../scripts/admin.js';</script></Admin>
